MODULE: DecommissionReleasesLogicalPinOnly
TARGET: DecommissionReleases
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: decommission releases the cursor pin only under the logical id, leaking the physical pin after a swap (the pre-fix defect)
PERTURBS: Delete

--- FIND
    /\ pinned' = pinned \ {Logical, bound}
--- REPLACE
    /\ pinned' = pinned \ {Logical}
--- END
